## App changes

**No ticket, no change** — pick or create a ticket in [`tmp/backlog/`](../../tmp/backlog/README.md) before editing `app/` or ticket-scoped paths. Any edit under **`app/`** must update the matching domain spec in **`tmp/`** when the ticket closes. **Spec ↔ code drift is never allowed.** See also [`tomb-dust-backlog.mdc`](tomb-dust-backlog.mdc).

**LLM narration:** [`tomb-dust-turn-truth-verify.mdc`](tomb-dust-turn-truth-verify.mdc) — TurnTruth + verify→retry before publish; reflect on every `app/gm` narration change.

**PyGame UI/UX:** [`tomb-dust-ui-ux.mdc`](tomb-dust-ui-ux.mdc) — component library, `theme.py`, layout zones, queue/data flow, scroll and accessibility conventions.

## After grid changes

```bash
python build/tools/av_grid.py validate && python build/tools/av_grid.py build-index
```
